    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewing Saturday the 19th 11:00am-11:30am!!\nRosmult, Rosmeen Park, Dún Laoghaire, is a charming detached family residence originally built in 1963, extending to approximately 125 sq.m. (1,345 sq.ft.), with the added benefit of a side garage of approximately 5 sq.m. Positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, this attractive home enjoys a highly sought-after setting within walking distance of Glasthule Village, the DART, and the stunning coastline. Offering privacy, convenience, and immense potential, Rosmult presents a rare opportunity to acquire a wonderful family home in one of South Dublin's most desirable residential locations.\n\nThe accommodation is both spacious and well-balanced, comprising four generous bedrooms, a large entrance hall, a family bathroom, and an impressive open-plan living and dining area that flows seamlessly into the kitchen at the rear. The west-facing rear garden enjoys excellent afternoon and evening sunshine, while the substantial side access and garage offer superb potential for extension or further development, subject to the necessary planning permissions. To the front, the property benefits from a private driveway and off-street parking.\n\nThe location is truly exceptional, renowned for its outstanding amenities and family-friendly atmosphere. Residents enjoy access to some of the area's finest schools, excellent transport links including the nearby DART, and a wealth of recreational facilities. The beautiful seafront, coastal walks, yacht clubs, sports clubs, and parks are all within easy reach, while the vibrant villages of Glasthule and Sandycove offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, and local services. Rosmult combines the best of coastal living with outstanding convenience, making it an ideal home for families seeking space, lifestyle, and future potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Special Features</li><li> Highly sought-after Dún Laoghaire address</li><li> Detached residence with immense potential</li><li> Superb west-facing rear aspect</li><li> Excellent extension potential (S.P.P.) with large side garden</li><li> Four-bedroom family accommodation c130sqm including the garage</li><li> Generous open-plan living space</li><li> Garage and side access</li><li> Private off-street parking</li><li> End of quiet family-friendly cul-de-sac</li><li> Close to schools, DART and coastline</ul>"
      },
